WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.288
Welcome to Zenith Studio. One concise schema defines this API and its data relationship.

2
00:00:06.468 --> 00:00:12.252
Account is inverse. Profile owns the one-to-one link and its unique account ID foreign key.

3
00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:20.424
The ERD confirms one-to-one. The repository tree shows generated entities. repositories. services. and controllers.

4
00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:27.492
Run starts Spring Boot with an in-memory H2 database. The console shows Maven building and Spring starting.

5
00:00:27.672 --> 00:00:33.768
When startup completes. we register a user and use its token to create. list. fetch. and update an account.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.920
Then we create a linked profile. list it. fetch by ID. and update its display name.

7
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.728
Every request succeeds. We finish by deleting both records.

8
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.224
Ten CRUD routes passed. from schema to live API in Zenith Studio.
